  metadata {
    name = "example-deployment"
  }

  spec {
    replicas = 10  # Increase the number of replicas

    selector {
      match_labels = {
        app = "example"
      }
    }

    template {
      metadata {
        labels = {
          app = "example"
        }
      }

      spec {
        container {
          image = "nginx:latest"
          name  = "nginx"

          port {
            container_port = 80
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### 2. Optimize Service Configuration

Ensure your service is configured to handle the increased load. You can use a `LoadBalancer` type service if you are deploying to a cloud provider that supports it.

```hcl
resource "kubernetes_service" "example" {
  metadata {
    name = "example-service"
  }

  spec {
    selector = {
      app = "example"
    }

