### 1. Use Modules for Reusability

Modules allow you to encapsulate reusable components, making your code more modular and easier to maintain.

#### Example Module Structure

Create a directory structure for your modules:

```
modules/
  ec2_instance/
    main.tf
    variables.tf
    outputs.tf
```

