    @Autowired
    private DataSource dataSource;

    @Bean
    public Flyway flyway() {
        Flyway flyway = Flyway.configure()
                .dataSource(dataSource)
                .locations("classpath:db/migration")
                .load();
        return flyway;
    }
}
```

### Step 4: Apply Migrations

You can apply migrations programmatically or through a command-line interface. Here's an example of applying migrations programmatically.

