# For production environment
./mvnw spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=prod
```

### Summary

By defining environment-specific properties, configuring the data source based on the active profile, and setting up Flyway to use the data source, you can effectively manage database migrations across multiple environments. This approach ensures that each environment uses the correct data source and applies the appropriate migrations.

